{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Herringen is a free-flight arcade bomber game with a retro aesthetic. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You control a ship armed with heavy explosives and are tasked with taking down an impossibly large Fortress under a moody, colour-compressed sky.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evade attacks, take breakneck trajectories through obstacles and destroy your target as fast as you can to improve your score.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423360/extras/12f2bb5f168fbbb6731c119adddc8927.poster.avif?t=1761565436\" width=500 height=166 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423360/extras/12f2bb5f168fbbb6731c119adddc8927.webm?t=1761565436\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423360/extras/12f2bb5f168fbbb6731c119adddc8927.mp4?t=1761565436\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Satisfying Evades</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sharp reflexes are rewarded with astonishing speed and a full reload of your bombs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Depth &amp; Inertia</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mastering movement  will make the difference between life and death. Know the weight of your ship, let it become an extension of your body.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423360/extras/fbad89c3c212eb59beed0336cd585124.poster.avif?t=1761565436\" width=500 height=166 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423360/extras/fbad89c3c212eb59beed0336cd585124.webm?t=1761565436\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423360/extras/fbad89c3c212eb59beed0336cd585124.mp4?t=1761565436\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Imposing Fortress</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many interconnected paths are available to you: understand the architecture of your target and obliterate it.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Power from Danger</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every enemy projectile an opportunity to reload, every obstacle an agility boost. Play on an absolute razor's edge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scoring &amp; Leaderboard</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroying the Fortress is one thing, doing it well is another. Learn, try again, improve your score and climb the leaderboard.\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423360/extras/fc94d8b456d7fbbcd9d1d121e1e1e635.poster.avif?t=1761565436\" width=498 height=164 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423360/extras/fc94d8b456d7fbbcd9d1d121e1e1e635.webm?t=1761565436\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423360/extras/fc94d8b456d7fbbcd9d1d121e1e1e635.mp4?t=1761565436\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3423360?t=1761565436","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423360/06fb149ba27ae9c18a70486f2d27959f18339ba4/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761565436","capsule_image":"https://shar